{"id":"versprechen","lemma":"Versprechen","pos":"noun","rank":596,"glosses":["promise (vow)"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈʃpʁɛçən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/93/De-Versprechen.ogg/De-Versprechen.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Versprechens","plural":"Versprechen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ist das ein Versprechen?","en":"Is that a promise?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390468","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Das können wir nicht versprechen.","en":"We can't promise that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755825","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Du musst deine Versprechen halten.","en":"You have to keep your promise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593007","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to hold"}]},{"text":"Hast du dein Versprechen schon vergessen?","en":"Have you already forgotten your promise?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"already"},{"g":"to forget"}]},{"text":"Habt ihr euer Versprechen schon vergessen?","en":"Have you already forgotten your promise?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"already"},{"g":"to forget"}]}]}